    </see>
    <see file="02_mbml.md" relation="AuthoringGuide">
      Namespaces — xmlns bindings, context-bound implicit namespace, and Block FQN resolution.
    </see>
    <see file="15_dev_setup.md" relation="AuthoringGuide">
      Package Conventions — npm packages vs. FQN namespaces.
    </see>
    <see file="06_compiler.md" relation="DeepDive">
      BML_OUTSIDE_BML_NAMESPACE — validation error code.
    </see>
    <see type="doc:LibrarySystem" relation="SeeAlso">
      Libraries, packages, and namespace membership — related reading.
    </see>
    <see type="doc:ImplicitNamespaceResolution" relation="SeeAlso">
      Context-bound implicit namespace — unqualified references at specialized sites.
    </see>
  </references>

</block>
